SULTAN E DEEN SHAHE KHURASAA GUZARGAYA <br>
MAMOON NA RASHHED KA MEHMAA GUZARGAYA<br>
<br>
1. ANGOOR ZAHERDAAR NE MARA IMAM KO <br>
 KAZIM KA LAAL BOLTA QURAAN GUZARGAYA<br>
<br>
2. BEWAA YATEEM BACCHOUN KE WALI NE KI QAZA <br>
 BE WARISOO KA HAAYR NIGHEBAAN GUZARGAYA<br>
<br>
3. MOULA TAQI YATEEM HOVEY MARGAYE RAZA <br>
 KOUNAIN KE SUKUN KA SAAMA GUZARGAYA<br>
<br>
4. GURBAT MEIN SHAAN SE UTHI MAYYAT GARIB KI <br>
 BE KAS PUKARA DARD KA DARMAAN GUZARGAYA<br>
<br>
5. GHAM KE PAHAD TOODE HAI UMMAT NE MUSTAFA <br>
 EK AUR AAJ MAASIRE YAZDAA GUZARGAYA